[I] 1 or 2 players race through a multi-level maze

[T] BumpRace is a simple SDL arcade game in which one or two players race a
[T] ship through a multi-level maze, avoiding walls and bumpers while
[T] collecting bonuses.

[U] https://www.linux-games.com/bumprace/

